# Browser
# What the page shows of Delighted Halfling's mana (CR 106.6): the pool's chip says both what it is for and what it does to
# the spell, since mana limited to legendary spells alone is other mana with a caption of its own; its card menu words each
# color the same way. Lightning Bolt can't be cast with it, and Ragavan, a legendary creature, can.

